SUMMARY:ALEGRIA HALLOWEEN WEEKEND / ALEGRIA + VIVA\, DJ Rob Phillips\, DJ J
 
erac
LOCATION:Palladium Times Square \, Midtown-Times Square
DESCRIPTION:ALEGRIA HALLOWEEN WEEKEND 2026 / ALEGRIA + VIVAALEGRIA HALLOWEE
 
N WEEKEND NYC 2026 Halloween falls on a Saturday this year\, and ALEGRIA is
 
 ready to celebrate with the return of one of our biggest and most anticipa
 
ted weekends of the year! Join us on Saturday\, October 31st --- Halloween 
 
Night --- for ALEGRIA HALLOWEEN\, followed by VIVA Afterhours on Sunday mor
 
ning\, November 1st. Two back-to-back events\, four incredible DJs and 16 h
 
ours of nonstop music celebrating Halloween in New York City. For more than
 
 two decades\, ALEGRIA HALLOWEEN has become a NYC tradition\, known for its
 
 incredible costumes\, spectacular production and a packed dance floor that
 
 makes Halloween one of our favorite ALEGRIA nights of the year. ALEGRIA HA
 
LLOWEEN takes over Palladium Times Square on Saturday night from 10PM to 6A
 
M\, featuring Alberto Ponzo and Leanh. Then\, just a few minutes away\, the
 
 celebration continues at Harbor NYC with VIVA Afterhours from 6AM to 2PM o
 
n Sunday\, featuring Rob Phillips and Jerac. 2-Event Passes for ALEGRIA + V
 
IVA are also be available. If you're planning to attend both events\, the 2
 
-Event Pass is the best option\, giving you express check-in at VIVA while 
 
paying only one ticketing fee for both events. For individual Alegria GA an
 
d VIP tickets or more information go to www.RicSenaPresents.com Tickets & i
 
nfo: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/alegria-halloween-weekend-alegria-pall
 
adium-times-square-tickets/14285164
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/alegria-halloween-weekend-alegria-palla
 
dium-times-square-tickets/14285164
END:VEVENT
