SUMMARY:Michael Blake Quartet: Halloween Tales
LOCATION:Birdland Theater\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:New York saxophonist Michael Blake stakes out fresh territory i
 
n holiday jazz with Halloween Tales\, out September 25\, 2026. While the ge
 
nre has typically belonged to the winter holidays\, Blakes new release clai
 
ms the mystery\, humor and cinematic atmosphere of Halloween and the harves
 
t season instead\, channeled through inventive arrangements and inspired im
 
provisation. Joined by Gary Versace on piano\, Ben Allison on bass and Mich
 
ael Sarin on drums\, Blake leads a classic quartet lineup as a deliberate c
 
hoice meant to echo the instrumentation of the holiday jazz records that sh
 
aped his own listening. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/mic
 
hael-blake-quartet-halloween-tales-birdland-theater-tickets/14278924
